- [Mark] Okay, Cassandra,

01:09:29.717 --> 01:09:33.083
thank you very much for
sharing this amazing story.

01:09:35.940 --> 01:09:37.760
I'd love to have you back
again, we'll do it again.

01:09:37.760 --> 01:09:39.130
Because I think there's a lot more of it.

